    "ESP32 Agent follows your iPhone's language. To change it just for this app, open Settings › ESP32 Agent › Language." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ESP32 Agent 跟随 iPhone 的语言。只想改这个 App 的语言，请打开 设置 › ESP32 Agent › 语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ESP32 Agent is experimental software that controls this iPhone on its own. It can tap the wrong thing, send messages, change settings, buy things or delete data. Watch it while it runs and stop it if anything looks wrong. Screenshots of your screen are sent to the model endpoint you choose. You use it at your own risk; the authors accept no liability for any loss or damage." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ESP32 Agent 是实验性软件，会自行操作这台 iPhone。它可能点错、发出消息、修改设置、购买东西或删除数据。运行时请看着它，发现不对立即停止。屏幕截图会发送到你选择的模型接口。使用风险由你自行承担；作者不对任何损失负责。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
